==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Send out a fast, cheap meatshield to cause the initial zombie peons to burrow. Try to kill Ursamajor as soon as possible or you'll have to deal with them and Cadaver Bear at the same time. Save your cat cannon in case Cadaver burrows to your base. Catellite can be helpful here as it is immune to the Star Pengs' warp.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Since the Cadaver Bear spawns on a timer, you can use [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kitty of Liberty]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] to cheese it before the bear spawns since there is no Ursamajor here unlike in Chapter 1.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage can also be rushed with a few Starting Money UP combos. Once the first Relic Doge gets to the base, send out a Can Can to one-shot him (if one-shot not possible, use Bullet Train to get some chip), then immediately deploy Awakened Bahamut (needs Explosion). Make sure to send out Manic Lions to protect Bahamut once the Ursamajor is knocked back behind the base.

